n":"Single","zh":"單身","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"30 kilometers","zh":"30公里","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"10GBASE -\n爾\n802.3 ae\n10 Gbps (英語).\n單身\n30公里","kind":"prose"},{"en":"UTP vs Fiber-Optic Cabling:","source":"text","id":"p8-b15","segments":[{"en":"UTP vs Fiber-Optic Cabling:","zh":"UTP vs 纖維-奧布克林:","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"UTP vs 纖維-奧布克林:","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":9,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0009.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"UTP are:","source":"text","id":"p9-b1","segments":[{"en":"UTP are:","zh":"UTP是:","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"UTP是:","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nLower cost than fiber-optic. \n• \nShorter maximum distance than fiber-optic (~100m). \n• \nCan be vulnerable to EMI (Electromagnetic Interference). \n• \nRJ45 ports used with UTP are cheaper than SFP ports. \n• \nEmit (leak) a faint signal outside of cable, which can be copied (security risk). \nFiber-Optic:","source":"text","id":"p9-b2","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Lower cost than fiber-optic.","zh":"比光纖成本低。","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Shorter maximum distance than fiber-optic (~100m).","zh":"比光纖(~100m)更短的最大距離.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Can be vulnerable to EMI (Electromagnetic Interference).","zh":"可能易被mi(電磁干擾).","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"RJ45 ports used with UTP are cheaper than SFP ports.","zh":"rj45 與UTP一起使用的埠比SFP埠便宜.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Emit (leak) a faint signal outside of cable, which can be copied (security risk).","zh":"電線外的微弱訊號可以被複制(安全隱患).","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"Fiber-Optic:","zh":"纖維- Optic :","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n比光纖成本低。\n•\n比光纖(~100m)更短的最大距離.\n•\n可能易被mi(電磁干擾).\n•\nrj45 與UTP一起使用的埠比SFP埠便宜.\n•\n電線外的微弱訊號可以被複制(安全隱患).\n纖維- Optic :","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nHigher cost than UTP. \n• \nLonger maximum distance than UTP. \n• \nNo vulnerability to EMI. \n• \nSFP ports are more expensive than RJ45 ports (single-mode is more expensive than multimode). \n• \nDoes not emit any signal outside of the cable (no security risk).","source":"text","id":"p9-b3","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Higher cost than UTP.","zh":"成本高於UTP.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Longer maximum distance than UTP.","zh":"比UTP更長的最大距離.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"No vulnerability to EMI.","zh":"與emi無關。","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"SFP ports are more expensive than RJ45 ports (single-mode is more expensive than multimode).","zh":"SFP港口比rj45港口更貴(單相模比多相模更貴).","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Does not emit any signal outside of the cable (no security risk).","zh":"不得在電纜外發射任何訊號(無安全風險)。","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n成本高於UTP.\n•\n比UTP更長的最大距離.\n•\n與emi無關。\n•\nSFP港口比rj45港口更貴(單相模比多相模更貴).\n•\n不得在電纜外發射任何訊號(無安全風險)。","kind":"prose"}]}]}